kerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":1567917906,"text":"こんにちは！クシャレワー学院のダヤです！あなたも学院フェスに参加しにいらしたんですか？","nextNodeIds":[736900102]},{"nodeId":736900102,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":2298564122,"text":"こちらは私たちの学院が企画した遊び——「ルート構想計画」ですよ！","nextNodeIds":[736900103]},{"nodeId":736900103,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":2412295362,"text":"どうですか？試してみませんか？","nextNodeIds":[736900104]},{"nodeId":736900104,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":100844274,"text":"たしか、クシャレワー学院の研究は…","nextNodeIds":[736900105]},{"nodeId":736900105,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":3265675490,"text":"私たちの学院の研究は、ほとんどがギミックや建築などに関わるものです。","nextNodeIds":[736900107]},{"nodeId":736900107,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":3799380202,"text":"コホン、話が逸れてしまいましたね…今回の学院フェスに参加するため、我が学院の多くの学生がみんなで知恵を絞りました…","nextNodeIds":[736900108]},{"nodeId":736900108,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":3124051114,"text":"そのすえに、「ルート構想計画」という遊びを考案したのです！","nextNodeIds":[736900109]},{"nodeId":736900109,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":243141482,"text":"簡単に言うと、プレイヤーはこちらが用意した様々なアイテムを使ってルートを作る必要があります。","nextNodeIds":[736900110]},{"nodeId":736900110,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":1086976658,"text":"橋を架けたり、階段を設置したり…最終的な目標は、人が通れるようにしたうえで、目的地にたどり着けるルートを作ることです。","nextNodeIds":[736900111]},{"nodeId":736900111,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":906802930,"text":"道の構築が完了した後、私たちが最終的な検証を行います…建物を建てたあとの検収みたいなものです。","nextNodeIds":[736900112]},{"nodeId":736900112,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":421319794,"text":"とにかく、安全なルートを作ることができれば目標クリアとなりますよ。","nextNodeIds":[736900113,736900114]},{"nodeId":736900113,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2862122762,"text":"なんだか難しそう…","nextNodeIds":[736900115]},{"nodeId":736900115,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":2162050642,"text":"ふふ、心配することはありません。現実世界で建てるわけではありませんから。","nextNodeIds":[736900116]},{"nodeId":736900116,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":2913749826,"text":"たとえ失敗して、ルートが崩れてしまっても大丈夫ですよ。作り直せばいいだけですから。試行回数の制限も設けていません。","nextNodeIds":[736900117]},{"nodeId":736900117,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":3349348762,"text":"想像力を発揮して、あなたの思う美しいルートを作ればいいのです！","nextNodeIds":[736900118,736900120]},{"nodeId":736900118,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":2860097618,"text":"試してみたい。","nextNodeIds":[736900119]},{"nodeId":736900119,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":4058594858,"text":"分かりました。それでは、まずこちらをご覧ください…","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736900120,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3782199394,"text":"他に用事がある。","nextNodeIds":[736900121]},{"nodeId":736900121,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":432038330,"text":"そうですか…大丈夫ですよ！学院フェス期間中、私たちのブースはずっと開いていますから。","nextNodeIds":[736900122]},{"nodeId":736900122,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_NPC","speakerId":30349,"speakerName":"ダヤ","textMapHash":1177470186,"text":"試してみたい時は、いつでも来てくださいね。","nextNodeIds":[]},{"nodeId":736900114,"roleType":"TALK_ROLE_PLAYER","speakerId":null,"speakerName":"旅人","textMapHash":3424188202,"text":"建築の才能はあんまり…","nextNodeIds":[736900115]}]}],"conditions":{"finishCond":[{"BFGALAINLMD":0,"LNHLPKELCAL":[7369001,0],"PAINLIBBLDK":"QUEST_CONTENT_COMPLETE_TALK","PPFLKMOMKAI":""}],"triggerCond":[],"execActions":[],"guide":{"BEALNDJFMMC":"QUEST_GUIDE_IN_SCENE_STYLE_NONE","BJKFMDGPIBN":"QUEST_GUIDE_INDICATOR_STYLE_NONE","CCLPMCLNLBJ":"NONE","CJHEDKCIHPA":0,"EMAIG